# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal data. These are YOUR links and YOUR downloads -- never publish them.
# The patterns are deliberately broad: this repo lives next to real collections.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
links.txt
*links*.txt
x-media/
media/
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.webm
*.mov
*.m4v
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.webp
.x-download-state.json
.x-flatten-manifest.json
cookies.txt
*.cookies

# Art that ships is whitelisted back in above the ignores.
!extension/icons/*.png
!docs/**/*.png
!docs/**/*.svg

# Logo working files: the repo carries the masters, not every exported size.
# The other exports stay on disk, they are just not worth 1.8 MB of history.
docs/logo/*
!docs/logo/abel-neon-1024.png
!docs/logo/abel-neon.svg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
receiver/target/
downloader/.venv/
dist/
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and operating systems
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
